    "body": "I would love it if someone did a holistic refactor of the attribute change steps (and insertion steps, and connected steps, etc...). https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7712 and https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2771 kind of discuss that.\r\n\r\nI don't think it's the highest-priority work, but it would be nice. It's just a lot of busywork moving stuff around.",
